00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:42.450
But my job is not to
talk to you about that.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:43.950
My job is to talk to other people.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.140
- He kind of represents
what I think I like,

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:47.730
am trying to not do.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.650
Literally like, people here
have never heard of him

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.470
because he exists within
the liberal echo chamber.

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.610
I don't know if it changes minds.

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:54.990
It just like cements the,

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:59.010
- Your tribe or whatever. It
feels like the politicians

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:01.110
and as usual, people in charge

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:02.850
that are controlling everything
are taking advantage of

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.740
the people who have good intentions and

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.570
have been kind people.

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:08.190
Everyone I've talked to has been cool.

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:11.280
You can still find the
views absolutely disgusting,

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.200
and I do see some of them that way.

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:15.540
Politics is just one aspect of a person.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:16.710
You know, there's a lot more to 'em.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.220
- Maybe some of them are
confused, but they're,

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.310
they, they can still be kind.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.810
There, there are people on the top that

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.342
are manipulating everyone below.

00:17:24.342 --> 00:17:27.600
(psychedelic music)

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.210
I stepped back into the convention
center and the fervor of

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:31.920
the crowd was increasing.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.900
Everyone was getting more and more excited

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:36.240
that Trump was about to take the stage.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:37.740
And so on my way back in,

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.180
I ran into a few new friends.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.267
How this looks. Ay!

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:43.920
Then I ran into Craig and
the conversation weirdly

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.174
turned to Burning Man.

00:17:45.174 --> 00:17:46.917
- Do you want to go?

00:17:46.917 --> 00:17:47.924
- No, of course not.

00:17:47.924 --> 00:17:48.757
- Why not?

00:17:48.757 --> 00:17:50.003
- It's a miserable, terrible place.

00:17:50.003 --> 00:17:50.836
- Really?

00:17:50.836 --> 00:17:53.700
- You are building community
from the ground up.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:54.533
Isn't that exciting?

00:17:54.533 --> 00:17:55.650
- You are using all the buzz words.

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:58.140
Oh, you're building community.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.460
- But isn't that what we're doing here?

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:00.690
Like, we're building community.

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:01.863
You're talking to people like,

00:18:01.863 --> 00:18:03.810
like this is a community
right here, right?

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:06.824
- I know what you're saying, but you know.

00:18:06.824 --> 00:18:08.643
- Wait, why the eye
roll? Why the eye roll?

00:18:08.643 --> 00:18:10.740
I'm, I'm probably not
using the same, like,

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:14.850
like, vocab that maybe
like, is more familiar,

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:16.980
but I feel like we're talking
about the same thing, right?

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:19.860
What rubs you wrong about what I'm saying?

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.720
- It doesn't rub me wrong.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:22.553
- But you rolled your eyes.

00:18:22.553 --> 00:18:25.380
- Anytime someone uses that word.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.213
- Community?

00:18:26.213 --> 00:18:27.046
- Yeah.

00:18:27.046 --> 00:18:29.100
- Yeah.
- You know, it's

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:33.150
you're trying to adopt significance.

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:36.709
- Isn't that what we're all trying to do?

00:18:36.709 --> 00:18:39.542
(audience cheers)

00:18:40.873 --> 00:18:44.367
(intense music builds up)

00:18:44.367 --> 00:18:47.200
(audience cheers)

00:19:00.185 --> 00:19:03.352
(upbeat music builds)

00:19:05.642 --> 00:19:09.221
(audience cheering)

00:19:09.221 --> 00:19:11.804
(upbeat music)

