See you, Buddy!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:38.970
Hey, do you wanna be friends?

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:39.803
- Huh?

00:19:39.803 --> 00:19:41.541
- Do you wanna be friends?

00:19:41.541 --> 00:19:42.374
- What?

00:19:42.374 --> 00:19:43.207
- Do you want to be friends?
- Yeah.

00:19:43.207 --> 00:19:44.040
- Yeah. My name's Sam.
- Hi.

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:46.890
- Helen, what did you
think of Trump's speech?

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:47.982
- Oh, I loved him.

00:19:47.982 --> 00:19:48.815
- Yeah?
- Yeah.

00:19:48.815 --> 00:19:49.980
Yeah, I'm actually, I would actually

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:51.430
consider myself a liberal, of

00:19:52.413 --> 00:19:53.246
uh, would you,

00:19:53.246 --> 00:19:54.079
(Helen mumbles)

00:19:54.079 --> 00:19:55.929
- Go ahead, talk to
her. I, I need to get a,

00:19:55.929 --> 00:19:58.091
- Would you be friends with a liberal?

00:19:58.091 --> 00:19:58.924
- Nuh-uh.

00:19:58.924 --> 00:19:59.757
- Why not?

00:19:59.757 --> 00:20:00.590
- 'Cause.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.590
