00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:20.910
- I got some breakfast burritos,

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:22.290
and
- Oh my god, amazing.

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:24.225
Oh, thank you. Appreciate it.

00:20:24.225 --> 00:20:25.058
- This is Samuel.

00:20:25.058 --> 00:20:25.891
- Hello.

00:20:25.891 --> 00:20:26.818
- One of Holly's friends.
- Hello.

00:20:26.818 --> 00:20:28.170
- And now we're all new friends.

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.003
- So let's pray.

00:20:29.003 --> 00:20:31.230
Our Lord Jesus. We just thank
you so much for this day.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:32.850
And for this gathering of people, God,

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:34.740
we ask that you would be glorified,

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:35.940
that all that we hear and say,

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:39.750
God would just draw us closer to you.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.270
Lord, help us to love you and
love those around us more.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.680
Hear my prayer. Thank you. Amen.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.513
- [Together] Amen.

