00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:55.913
- Yes.

00:20:55.913 --> 00:20:58.200
- But thank you so much
for like inviting you,

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.119
us into this world.

00:21:00.119 --> 00:21:01.261
- [Woman] Can I take
a selfie really quick?

00:21:01.261 --> 00:21:03.990
- Yes, of course. (laughs)

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.421
Thank you for inviting me.

00:21:05.421 --> 00:21:06.960
- [Women] Yeah!
- Yah!

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:08.070
They're a fun group of people.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.270
- [Malik] I like that.

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:10.200
- Yeah.
- That was nice.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.490
- It was super wholesome.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:14.040
- One time that people
were just all happy.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.960
- Let's head out.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.060
As Malik and I headed to the airport,

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:20.250
I was reflecting on this whole trip

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.290
and this whole idea of friendship.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:23.970
Malik and I met randomly
at UCLA a few months ago,

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:24.803
all because I asked him,

00:21:24.803 --> 00:21:26.550
"Hey, do you guys wanna be friends?"

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.400
He could've said no, and so
much would've been different.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:30.840
But because he said yes,

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:33.060
it led to us traveling across the country

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.470
and doing something
that we'll both remember

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:36.120
for the rest of our lives.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.910
This friendship, like most
of the best things in life

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:42.090
started out with a small
step, a tiny interaction.

00:21:42.090 --> 00:21:43.380
A question.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:45.930
Now, it's led to this deep friendship.

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:46.763
On this journey,

00:21:46.763 --> 00:21:48.300
we connected with so many people

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.490
that didn't share our politics at all.

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:53.820
And it left me wondering if
this divide, Trump versus Biden,

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:57.090
red versus blue, Democrat
versus Republican.

00:21:57.090 --> 00:22:00.093
It's way of thinking that
doesn't serve anyone.

